MORET_BEGIN
GODIVA systeme perturbe identique au systeme initial
* Hypothese : H36 2e systeme perturbe = systeme initial (REPL 2 ACIER2 ACIER, dkeff_2 = 0 exactement) : 1re execution 2026-10-15 -> forrtl error (73) floating divide by zero apres impression de keff et dkeff, sans banniere
* Attendu    : NO END BANNER avec mean_keff et dkeff presents ; le plugin doit signaler l echec

GEOM
  MODU 0
    TYPE 1 SPHE 10.7407
    VOLU 1 0 1 refl 0. 0. 0.
    TYPE 2 SPHE 8.7407
    VOLU 2 1 2 UMET 0. 0. 0.
  ENDM
ENDG

MATE
  CONT
    LIBR jeff311.xml
    TEMP 300
    COMP UMET
      CONC
        U234 4.91895E-04
        U235 4.49988E-02
        U238 2.49865E-03
    ENDC
    COMP ACIER
      CONC
        FE56 8.4E-02
    ENDC
    COMP ACIER2
      CONC
        FE56 7.6E-02
    ENDC
  ENDM

ASSO
  MEDI refl ACIER
    REPL 2 ACIER2 ACIER
ENDA

SOUR
  UNIF 1000
ENDS

TERM
  CYCL PASS 30 ACTI 100
ENDT

ENDD
MORET_END
